  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">CTR Reforma del Sector Agrcola</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RTC Agriculture Sector Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WITH THE OBJECTIVE OF BRINGING WASA INTO COMPLIANCE WITH BANK&apos;S MINIMUM REQUIREMENTS FOR QUALIFYING FOR PROJECT FINANCING, REFORM PROGRAM WOULD BE DIRECTED AT THREE PRINCIPAL AREAS OF WASA&apos;S OPERATIONS: REPAIR OF LEAKAGES IN ITS WATER SYSTEM AND REPLACEMENT OF OBSOLECENT PIPE, ACQUISITION AND INSTALLATION OF METERS, AND DESIGN AND EQUIPPING OF BILLING SYSTEM BASED ON CONSUMPTION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
